    "name": {
      "en": "Bibi-Khanym Mosque",
      "zh": "比比哈努姆清真寺"
    },
    "category": "architecture",
    "shortDescription": {
      "en": "An enormous congregational mosque that began collapsing almost as soon as it was built.",
      "zh": "规模惊人的主麻清真寺，建成不久便开始坍塌。"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Timur pushed his builders past what the engineering of the 1390s could hold, and the arches started failing within decades. Much of what stands now is a twentieth-century reconstruction, but the scale is intact and the enormous marble Quran stand in the courtyard is original. Pair it with the bazaar next door — they are two minutes apart.",
      "zh": "帖木儿把工匠逼到了1390年代结构技术的极限之外，拱券在几十年内就开始失效。今天所见大多是二十世纪的重建，但体量仍然震撼，庭院中那座巨大的大理石经架是原物。可与隔壁的巴扎连在一起看——两者相距不过两分钟路程。"
    },
