  {
    "id": "ulugbek-observatory",
    "cityId": "samarkand",
    "name": {
      "en": "Ulugh Beg Observatory",
      "zh": "兀鲁伯天文台"
    },
    "category": "museum",
    "shortDescription": {
      "en": "The buried arc of a 15th-century sextant that measured the year to within a minute.",
      "zh": "埋于地下的十五世纪六分仪弧，把一年的长度测到了分钟级误差。"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "Ulugh Beg was a working astronomer who happened to rule an empire. His observatory held a marble sextant around forty metres tall, sunk into the hillside for stability; the underground section survives and you walk down beside it. His star catalogue of 1018 entries remained the most accurate in the world for two centuries. The small museum above puts the numbers in context and is worth the extra twenty minutes.",
      "zh": "兀鲁伯是一位真正从事观测的天文学家，只是恰好统治着一个帝国。他的天文台内建有一具约四十米高的大理石六分仪，为求稳定而嵌入山坡；地下部分保存至今，可以沿着它走下去。他编纂的1018颗恒星星表，在此后两百年间都是世界上最精确的。上方的小型博物馆能帮你理解这些数字的分量，值得多花二十分钟。"
    },
    "address": "Tashkent Road, Samarkand",
    "latitude": 39.6753,
    "longitude": 67.0053,
    "visitDuration": 60,
