    },
    "category": "historical",
    "shortDescription": {
      "en": "The emir's walled citadel — a city inside the city, occupied for around fifteen centuries.",
      "zh": "埃米尔的城中之城，被占用了大约十五个世纪。"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "The Ark was residence, treasury, prison and mint all at once, and the ramp up through the gate is the same one every ambassador climbed. Most of the interior was destroyed in 1920 during the Bolshevik assault on the city; what remains is a set of courtyards housing small museums. The throne court and the coronation court are the parts worth your time.",
      "zh": "雅克城堡同时是王宫、国库、监狱和铸币厂，穿过城门向上的那道斜坡，正是历代使节走过的同一条路。内部大部分在1920年布尔什维克攻城时被摧毁，如今留下的是几进院落和其中的小型博物馆。真正值得花时间的是御座庭院和加冕庭院。"
    },
