  {
    "id": "islam-khoja",
    "cityId": "khiva",
    "name": {
      "en": "Islam Khoja Minaret",
      "zh": "伊斯兰霍加宣礼塔"
    },
    "category": "architecture",
    "shortDescription": {
      "en": "The tallest minaret in the country, and the best view over the walled town.",
      "zh": "全国最高的宣礼塔，也是俯瞰围城的最佳视角。"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "About 57 metres, built in 1908–1910, with a spiral staircase that is genuinely tight and unlit — bring a phone torch, and skip it if you dislike enclosed spaces. The reward at the top is the only view that shows you Ichan Kala whole: flat roofs, domes, and the desert starting immediately outside the walls. Time the climb for the hour before sunset.",
      "zh": "塔高约57米，建于1908至1910年，内部螺旋楼梯确实狭窄且没有照明——请带手机手电，若不适应封闭空间就不要上。登顶的回报是唯一能看到伊禅卡拉全貌的视角：平屋顶、穹顶，以及紧贴城墙之外就开始的沙漠。请安排在日落前一小时登塔。"
    },
