    "description": {
      "en": "The oldest market in the city and still the loudest. The current dome was designed in 1980 and covers the butchers and the dairy counters — go up to the gallery to look down on the spice pyramids — while bread, plov and secondhand everything spill out into the streets around it. Come hungry and before two in the afternoon. This is where I take clients to try non bread and dried fruit before the long train ride.",
      "zh": "全城最古老的市场，至今也最喧闹。现在的穹顶设计于1980年，下面是肉档和奶制品柜台——上二层回廊往下看，可以看到堆成金字塔的香料——而馕、抓饭和各种旧货则溢到周边街道上。请空着肚子来，并在下午两点前到。长途火车前，我一般带客人来这里尝馕和干果。"
